{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50882","headline":"陪皮袭美陆鲁望重过鸟窠蹟 · 魏璞","name":"陪皮袭美陆鲁望重过鸟窠蹟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重探灵蹟到空山，山下茅庵几叩关。\n不爲白云招客屐，那教清境接人寰。\n螺池水色经年静，仙岭松声镇日闲。\n拟约高贤同结社，好移竹室住前湾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏璞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}